a the `-` argument, it prints `-` as the filename, but implicitly reading stdin prints nothing. I also need to handle `--files0-from` for reading NUL-delimited filenames and the `--total` flag which controls whether to print a summary line based on the file count.\n\nWriting the main implementation...\n\nActually, I'm reconsidering whether I need the cobra framework here. Looking at the project structure and the PRD, there's no indication that cmd/ packages should use cobra—it seems like the architecture expects minimal flag parsing and dependency wiring at the entry point level.\n\nLet me check what dependencies are actually available in go.mod to see what I'm working with.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1973,"cache_read_input_tokens":44920,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1973},"output_tokens":12,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8a115c45-1bdc-4b94-a522-324914dd00d1","uuid":"f82dd454-d016-47fc-8b26-9926e8f4430b"}
